    },
    "Drag over blemishes to heal · [ ] size · Shift-[ ] hardness · Escape cancel · Space to pan": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在瑕疵上拖动进行修复 · [ ] 调整大小 · Shift-[ ] 调整硬度 · Escape 取消 · Space 平移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a text box · Click text to edit · Drag box handles to resize · ⌘Return finish · Escape cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动创建文本框 · 点击文字编辑 · 拖动边框手柄调整大小 · ⌘Return 完成 · Escape 取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to draw · Drag ends to adjust · Shift 45° · 1–0 opacity · Enter apply · Escape cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动绘制 · 拖动端点调整 · Shift 约束 45° · 1–0 调整不透明度 · Enter 应用 · Escape 取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to crop · Enter apply · Escape cancel · Space to pan": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动裁剪 · Enter 应用 · Escape 取消 · Space 平移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to move · Handles to resize · Circle to rotate · 1–0 layer opacity · Space to pan": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动移动 · 手柄调整大小 · 圆形控件旋转 · 1–0 调整图层不透明度 · Space 平移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to pan · Pinch to zoom": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动平移 · 双指捏合缩放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No tool selected · Press a tool's key to pick one · Space to pan": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未选择工具 · 按工具快捷键选择 · Space 平移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click to zoom in · Option-click to zoom out · Drag right or left to zoom smoothly · Space to pan": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击放大 · Option 单击缩小 · 左右拖动连续缩放 · Space 平移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to resize the panel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动调整面板宽度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paint with the foreground color (B), or erase pixels away (E)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用前景色绘制（B），或擦除像素（E）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Liquify pushes pixels · Blur softens · Smudge drags color along": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "液化推动像素 · 模糊柔化 · 涂抹拖曳颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the source moving with the brush between strokes; off starts every stroke at the source point": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让仿制源随画笔在不同笔画间移动；关闭后每次笔画都从原始源点开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy from the active layer only, or from every visible layer as shown": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅从当前图层取样，或从所有可见图层的合成结果取样"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press 1–9 for 10–90%, 0 for 100%": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按 1–9 设置 10–90%，按 0 设置 100%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模糊柔化的像素半径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画笔以指定距离跟随指针，从而平滑手部抖动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Black · Hide": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "黑色 · 隐藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "White · Reveal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "白色 · 显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Option-click to set the source": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Option 单击设置源点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Parametric lifts tonal regions. Point places anchors on the curve.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参数曲线用于提升或压低色调区域；点曲线可在曲线上添加锚点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RGB changes brightness. Red, green, and blue also shift the color.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RGB 调整整体亮度；红、绿、蓝通道还会改变颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag up or down to lift or lower those tones. Drag a divider along the bottom to change which tones each region covers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上下拖动以提升或压低对应色调；拖动底部分隔线可调整各区域覆盖的色调范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lifts or lowers the brightest tones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提升或压低最亮色调。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lifts or lowers the light tones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提升或压低亮部色调。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lifts or lowers the dark tones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提升或压低暗部色调。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lifts or lowers the darkest tones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提升或压低最暗色调。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Medium Contrast": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中等对比度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strong Contrast": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强对比度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refine Saturation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精细饱和度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much the curve also changes color strength. Zero matches Photoshop; lower keeps it to brightness, higher adds more color.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制曲线对颜色强度的影响。0 与 Photoshop 行为一致；降低时更偏向只调整亮度，提高时会增加更多色彩变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag on the picture to move the curve for the tone under the pointer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在图像上拖动，根据指针下方的色调调整曲线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Targeted Adjustment": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标调整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shifts the selected color family around the wheel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沿色轮移动所选色系。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Makes the selected color family stronger or quieter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "增强或减弱所选色系的饱和度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Makes the selected color family lighter or darker.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提亮或压暗所选色系。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a color in the picture. Nearby color families move together.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在图像上拖动颜色，相邻色系会一起变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select this picked color.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择这个取样颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue Shift": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相偏移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shifts the picked color around the color wheel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沿色轮移动取样颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saturation Shift": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "饱和度偏移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Makes the picked color stronger or quieter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "增强或减弱取样颜色的饱和度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Luminance Shift": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明度偏移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Makes the picked color lighter or darker.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提亮或压暗取样颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue Range": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in hue the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置调整在色相上的影响范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saturation Range": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "饱和度范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in saturation the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置调整在饱和度上的影响范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Luminance Range": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明度范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in brightness the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置调整在亮度上的影响范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Visualize Range": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示影响范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dims the picture outside this color's range. It is not kept when you press OK.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将该颜色范围之外的画面变暗以便观察；按“确定”后不会保留此效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue and saturation of this wheel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该色轮的色相与饱和度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Brightness added by this wheel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该色轮增加的亮度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to set hue and saturation. Double-click to reset this wheel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动设置色相和饱和度；双击重置该色轮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tones from black on the left to white on the right: blacks, shadows, midtones, highlights, whites. Control-click to show the vectorscope.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从左侧黑色到右侧白色依次表示：黑色色阶、阴影、中间调、高光、白色色阶。Control 单击可显示矢量示波器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue around the wheel, saturation outward from the center. Control-click to show the histogram.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色轮周向表示色相，从中心向外表示饱和度。Control 单击可显示直方图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Red, green, and blue of the pixel under the pointer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示指针下像素的红、绿、蓝值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "R —   G —   B —": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "R —   G —   B —"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show clipped shadows in blue on the preview.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在预览中用蓝色显示阴影溢出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show clipped highlights in red on the preview.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在预览中用红色显示高光溢出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shadow Clipping Indicator": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "阴影溢出指示器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Clipping Indicator": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光溢出指示器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RGB histogram": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RGB 直方图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "White Balance Selector": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "白平衡取样器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Controls how strong the sharpening is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制锐化强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Emphasizes fine texture over broader edges.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相对于较大的边缘结构，更强调细小纹理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps local contrast after luminance smoothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在亮度平滑后保留局部对比度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Makes the color smoothing softer or tighter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整颜色平滑的柔和或紧密程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies generic profile strength when camera metadata is not available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有相机元数据时，使用通用配置文件强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No lens metadata on this layer. Profile sliders set generic correction strength.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前图层没有镜头元数据。配置文件滑块将设置通用校正强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile distortion correction is applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置应用多少配置文件畸变校正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile vignetting correction is applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置应用多少配置文件暗角校正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weakens purple fringes inside the purple hue range.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "减弱紫色色相范围内的紫边。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue range where purple defringe runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "紫边校正生效的色相范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weakens green fringes inside the green hue range.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "减弱绿色色相范围内的绿边。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue range where green defringe runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "绿边校正生效的色相范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moves the vignette correction inward or outward.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向内或向外移动暗角校正范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start of the hue range, in degrees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相范围起点（度）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End of the hue range, in degrees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相范围终点（度）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off leaves the picture as it is. Guided straightens from lines you draw on the picture.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时保持原图不变；引导模式根据你在图像上绘制的线条进行校正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove every guide line.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除所有参考线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perspective allows stronger keystone. Rectilinear keeps the warp gentler.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透视模式允许更强的梯形校正；直线模式的变形更温和。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Crops empty edges after the transform and fits the result back into the frame.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "变换后裁掉空白边缘，并将结果重新适配到画框内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chooses how strongly the calibration sliders below are applied. Version 6 is the current default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置下方校准滑块的应用强度。版本 6 为当前默认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds green or magenta to the darkest tones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为最暗区域增加绿色或洋红色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
