    "Shift Edge": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移动边缘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blend the chosen color into the edges while keeping the center unchanged": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将所选颜色混合到边缘，同时保持中心区域不变"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Protect bright areas near the edge": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保护靠近边缘的明亮区域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Positive straightens lines that bow outward (barrel); negative, lines that bow inward (pincushion).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正值校正向外弯曲的桶形畸变；负值校正向内弯曲的枕形畸变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limited to the selection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅作用于选区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pixel Size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "像素大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make each dithered pixel this many pixels across, for a chunky old-screen look": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置每个抖动像素的尺寸，用于形成粗颗粒的老式屏幕效果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The height of each line of characters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行字符的高度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the screen's lines are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕线条之间的间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light blooming around the lines, like a CRT's phosphors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在线条周围产生类似 CRT 荧光粉的辉光"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Break the lines into glowing beads": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将线条分解成发光点阵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make the lines waver sideways down the screen, like a CRT losing sync": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让线条沿屏幕横向摆动，模拟 CRT 失去同步的效果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于绘制的字符，可任意排列；每个位置会选择墨量最接近其色调的字符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tones per channel: 2 is pure black and white": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每通道色调数：2 表示纯黑白"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制每个像素的误差向相邻像素扩散的程度；较低时区域更平坦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More ink (darker) or less before dithering": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在抖动前增加或减少墨量（使画面更暗或更亮）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pixel Shape": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "像素形状"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draw each chunky pixel as a solid square, or as a round dot like a dot-matrix screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将大像素绘制为实心方块，或像点阵屏一样的圆点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light on Dark": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暗底亮纹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draw the marks for the light tones on the dark color, like a glowing screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在暗色背景上绘制亮色标记，模拟发光屏幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Linear runs along the line; Radial spreads out from the start point": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线性渐变沿线条延伸；径向渐变从起点向外扩散"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a custom grid color": {
      "localizations": {
