    "Color + neutral midtones": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色 + 中性中间调"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This layer supplies a live mask": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此图层提供实时蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These layers supply live masks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些图层提供实时蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bake keeps the current masked appearance in the dependent layers’ pixels. Remove Links reveals their pixels. You can undo either choice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“烘焙”会把当前蒙版效果写入依赖图层的像素；“移除链接”会显示这些图层原有像素。两种操作都可以撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That selection is too detailed to outline. Try a different Tolerance, or turn on Contiguous.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该选区过于复杂，无法生成轮廓。请尝试调整“容差”，或启用“连续”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn’t enough memory to make that selection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内存不足，无法创建该选区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load Mask Selection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "载入蒙版选区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load Layer Selection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "载入图层选区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Object Selection requires macOS 14 or later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对象选择需要 macOS 14 或更高版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The object mask could not be rendered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法渲染对象蒙版。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copied layers exceed this project’s %@-megapixel limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制的图层超过了此项目的 %@ 百万像素限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy Layers from Project": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从项目复制图层"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That shape is too large. A shape can cover up to %@ megapixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该形状过大。单个形状最多可覆盖 %@ 百万像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smudge and Liquify work on a layer's pixels, not its mask.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "涂抹和液化作用于图层像素，不能直接作用于其蒙版。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No foreground subject was detected in this layer. Try an image with a more distinct subject.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前图层未检测到前景主体。请尝试主体更清晰的图像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That text box exceeds the %@-pixel or %@-megapixel limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文本框超过了 %@ 像素边长或 %@ 百万像素的限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fill Text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填充文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cropped to the canvas so the file fits in memory. Pixels outside the canvas weren't imported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为了使文件适应内存限制，内容已裁剪到画布范围。画布外的像素未被导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The smart object was rasterized. Linked contents can’t be edited.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能对象已栅格化，链接内容无法继续编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Layer effects were discarded, so the appearance may differ.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图层效果已被丢弃，因此外观可能与 Photoshop 中不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vector shape was rasterized to pixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "矢量形状已栅格化为像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Photoshop layer type isn’t supported and was imported as pixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此 Photoshop 图层类型，已按像素图层导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folder blend mode “%@” isn’t supported. The folder will be pass-through.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持文件夹混合模式“%@”。该文件夹将使用穿透模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blend mode “%@” isn’t supported and will be applied as Normal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持混合模式“%@”，将按“正常”模式处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This adjustment type isn’t supported and was skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此调整类型，已跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjustment parameters may not match Photoshop exactly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整参数可能无法与 Photoshop 完全一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layer mask couldn’t be converted to 8-bit grayscale and was skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图层蒙版无法转换为 8 位灰度，已跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clipping mask’s base isn’t supported, so clipping was skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此剪贴蒙版的基底，因此已跳过剪贴关系。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Editable Photoshop text becomes pixels and can’t be retyped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可编辑的 Photoshop 文字已转换为像素，无法继续重新输入编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the first text style was kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅保留了第一种文字样式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop text warp was omitted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photoshop 的文字变形效果已省略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faux bold or faux italic was omitted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伪粗体或伪斜体效果已省略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full justification was imported as left alignment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两端对齐已按左对齐导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The font “%@” isn’t installed, so the text was drawn with the system font.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装字体“%@”，文字已使用系统字体绘制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop file could not be read. It may be damaged or incomplete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取 Photoshop 文件。文件可能已损坏或不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Photoshop file uses a format version Compositor can’t read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该 Photoshop 文件使用了 Compositor 无法读取的格式版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only 8-bit RGB Photoshop files can be imported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅支持导入 8 位 RGB Photoshop 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Photoshop file uses a layer compression method that isn’t supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该 Photoshop 文件使用了不受支持的图层压缩方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop stroke isn’t supported on shape layers and was omitted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "形状图层上的 Photoshop 描边暂不支持，已省略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移动像素"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sample color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取样颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缩小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom in": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to draw a shape on a new layer · Shift 45° · Option from center · Shift-U or Tab for the next shape · Escape cancel · Space to pan": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动在新图层上绘制形状 · Shift 约束为 45° · Option 从中心绘制 · Shift-U 或 Tab 切换下一个形状 · Escape 取消 · Space 平移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to draw a shape on a new layer · Shift square · Option from center · Shift-U or Tab for the next shape · Escape cancel · Space to pan": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动在新图层上绘制形状 · Shift 约束为正方形 · Option 从中心绘制 · Shift-U 或 Tab 切换下一个形状 · Escape 取消 · Space 平移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to draw a shape on a new layer · Shift circle · Option from center · Shift-U or Tab for the next shape · Escape cancel · Space to pan": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动在新图层上绘制形状 · Shift 约束为圆形 · Option 从中心绘制 · Shift-U 或 Tab 切换下一个形状 · Escape 取消 · Space 平移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In %@   Out %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入 %@   输出 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "in the preview": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（预览）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ degrees": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Input %@ · Output %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入 %@ · 输出 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double-click to reset.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双击重置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A subdivision every %@ pixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每 %@ 像素设置一个细分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use gridlines every %@–%@ pixels and %@–%@ subdivisions, no more than the pixels between gridlines.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网格线间距请设置为 %@–%@ 像素，细分数量设置为 %@–%@，且不能超过网格线之间的像素数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current: %@ × %@ pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前：%@ × %@ 像素"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Result: %@ × %@ pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结果：%@ × %@ 像素"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use 1–%@ pixels per side, up to %@ megapixels, and 1–9,600 pixels/inch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每边请输入 1–%@ 像素，最多 %@ 百万像素，分辨率为 1–9,600 像素/英寸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom in (⌘+), now %@. At 100%% each pixel of the JPEG is one pixel of the screen, as on the canvas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放大（⌘+），当前 %@。在 100%% 时，JPEG 的每个像素对应屏幕上的一个像素，与画布一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom out (⌘−), now %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缩小（⌘−），当前 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opacity digit %@ (type two for exact %%)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不透明度数字 %@（输入两位可精确设置百分比）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nudge %@ 1 px": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向%@微移 1 像素"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nudge %@ 10 px": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向%@微移 10 像素"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move selected pixels %@ 1 px": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将选中像素向%@移动 1 像素"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move selected pixels %@ 10 px": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将选中像素向%@移动 10 像素"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is reserved by macOS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已被 macOS 保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is assigned to both %@ and %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 同时分配给了 %@ 和 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本框保留标准 macOS 编辑快捷键。对话框共享上方的“应用/取消”快捷键。数值输入框使用上/下方向键，按住 Shift 可进行更大步进。标准 macOS 命令包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 全屏。快捷键编辑器在未录制按键时始终使用 Return 保存、Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the selection by this many pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选区指定像素数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a whole number from 1 to %@ px.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请输入 1 到 %@ px 之间的整数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
